  fhir:ImplementationGuide.description [ fhir:value "This Implementation Guide defines FHIR-based APIs for accessing and exchanging health data in the European Health Data Space (EHDS). It composes existing IHE and HL7 specifications — MHD for document exchange, SMART App Launch and IHE IUA for environment-specific authorization, PDQm for patient matching, and IPA for resource access — into a unified conformance target for EHR systems across Europe."] ;
